      "en": "How great are your works, LORD! Your thoughts are very deep.",
      "ko": "여호와여 주의 행사가 어찌 그리 크신지요 주의 생각이 심히 깊으시니이다",
      "source_text_hash": "966a79a5f7a8087ae835836ecb2a0ccaeafbd4d72cb6b1f855103893f17db444",
      "translation_text_hash": "754812deec5a475211046ed909e7310223a955f18004661f6e9c3ee0f1515de5",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
